.claude/skills/

# Windows shortcuts to files that already live in this repo.
*.lnk

# Raw RPC dumps kept while debugging Token-2022 reads. Scratch, never source.
t22.json

# Working notes, plans and session journals. Local only — the repo carries code.
docs/
iconset.png

# Agent tooling, not product.
.agents/
.claude/
.mcp.json
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json
test-artifacts/

# The copy of dist/ that gets pushed to the host. Generated, never edited.
web/public/
